; REVIEW DESIGN — not the byte-identical FPGA diagnostic image.
; Independent USER B Thread; DR11 belongs to its saved context.
; One progress increment per dispatch, then ordinary voluntary yield.
abstraction ide.CooperativeUserB {
    capabilities { SELF E, Boot.Thread }
    method Run() {
    Progress:
        IADD DR11, DR11, #1
        LOAD CR1, CR6, #1
        CHANGE CR1
        BRANCH Progress
    }
}
